{"result":"{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "302710790",
    "title": "04.1.10 Analytics and AB Testing",
    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/302710790",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 11,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. — source of truth. Req ID prefix: **AAB**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n| Req ID | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Config/Custom | Status | **Comments** | **User Story Link** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| AAB-001 | Tag Management & Data Layer | The system must load the GTM container on all storefront pages across all regional sites. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20%22AAB-001%22> |\n| AAB-002 | Tag Management & Data Layer | The system must populate a well-structured data layer that serves as the single source of truth for all downstream analytics and marketing tags, built natively in SFCC and covering all required customer and product interactions across the full shopping journey. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-002\\*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-002\\*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-002%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-002*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-002*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-002%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC) |\n| AAB-003 | Cookies & Consent Management | The system must consistently populate the data layer with all commerce and analytics events regardless of consent state. Didomi, operating at the tag layer, will gate advertising and personalisation tags so they only fire after the visitor has explicitly accepted. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-003\\*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-003\\*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-003%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-003*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-003*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-003%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC) |\n| AAB-004 | A-B Testing | The system will ensure the data layer populated in AAB-002 includes the attributes required for Optimizely audience segmentation - such as authenticated state, customer group, loyalty status, storefront region, new vs returning visitor and device type. | Zimmermann | ALL |  | Confirmed | Confirmed by Tell No Lies that Optimizely and Crazy Egg are out of the GTM container. They need separate frontend tags. The requirement should be \"The PWA Kit will load the Optimizely script directly on the page head, so that it initialises before render and A/B test variates can be applied without flicker.\" For Optimizely specifically, it is one snippet for all environments and it is only on the US website. | [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-004\\*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-004\\*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-004%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-004*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-004*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-004%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC) |\n| AAB-005 | Heatmapping & Session Replay | The system will ensure the data layer populated in AAB-002 includes page type, authenticated state and storefront region to support Crazy Egg segmentation and suppression configuration. | Zimmermann | ALL |  | Confirmed | Confirmed by Tell No Lies that Optimizely and Crazy Egg are out of the GTM container. They need separate frontend tags. The requirement should be \"The PWA Kit will load the Crazy Egg script directly on the page head, to enable full session recording and heatmap capture from page load.\" | [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-005\\*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-005\\*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-005%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=text%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-005*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-005*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20%22project%20%3D%20SFCC%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20AAB-005%22%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC) |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "1f4c4",
    "page_width": "fixed-width"
  }
}"}

