  "summary": "Didomi SDK — Load & Expose Consent Signal in PWA",
  "description": "As a Site Admin,\n\nI want the Didomi SDK loaded in the PWA,\n\nso that all components can read the customer's consent preferences at runtime and gate themselves accordingly.\n\nAccenture scope:\n\n- Load the Didomi SDK on all storefront pages via PWA Kit\n- Expose the Didomi consent API to the PWA so that components can read consent state per category at runtime\n- Integrate with Google Consent Mode v2\n\nOut of scope (Tell No Lies / Zimmermann):\n\n- All Didomi console configuration — vendor IDs, purpose IDs, cookie categories, regional defaults, banner UI\n\nThis story is a prerequisite for SFCC-106 (Consent Gating for PWA-Loaded Tracking & Personalisation Components).",
